        "TileImage": "$($repository 4208064d-b414-4b0c-a64d-fbcff5d96fb1).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rThe ICA has been contracted by construction mogul Kong Tuo-Kwang, who has an upcoming meeting in the Shisha Café. He desires this meeting to be free of prying eyes and ears, and as such has tasked us with the elimination of any persons located on the rooftops of Marrakesh. \r\rOut of sight, out of time, as it were.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
